| other  | 1970-01-01T00:05:00 | 0.08333333333333333                           |
| shared | 1970-01-01T00:02:00 | 0.75                                          |
| shared | 1970-01-01T00:03:00 | 1.5                                           |
| shared | 1970-01-01T00:04:00 | 1.5                                           |
| shared | 1970-01-01T00:05:00 | 1.5                                           |
+--------+---------------------+-----------------------------------------------+

